desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "python"
	title: "数据流：Python Path Traversal: User Input Used as File Path"
	title_zh: "数据流：Python 路径穿越：用户输入作为文件路径"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "ssa-python-path-traversal-open"
	risk: "path-traversal"
	cwe: "CWE-22"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 漏洞描述
请求参数进入 `open()` 的文件路径，且未经过规范化与根目录限制。攻击者可用 `../` 读取任意文件。

### 检测方式
跟踪 Flask/Django 请求参数到 `open()` 的第一个参数。路径经过 `resolve`、`realpath`、`abspath` 处理时跳过。

### 风险类型
path-traversal
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
先用 `pathlib.Path.resolve()` 规范化路径，再确认结果位于允许的根目录内：

```python
root = pathlib.Path("/var/data").resolve()
target = (root / name).resolve()
if target != root and root not in target.parents:
    abort(404)
```

不要直接把请求参数传给 `open()`。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-22: Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/22.html)
REFERENCE
	alert_min: 1
)

request.args.get(* as $src)
request.form.get(* as $src)
request.values.get(* as $src)
request.GET.get(* as $src)
request.POST.get(* as $src)

open(* as $arg)
$arg?{<self> #{include: <<<CODE
* & $src as $__next__
CODE
}->}?{!(<self> #{include: <<<CODE
*?{opcode: call && (<self><getCallee>?{have: /(?i)(resolve|realpath|abspath)/})} as $__next__
CODE
}->)} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Python Path Traversal: User Input Used as File Path",
	title_zh: "Python 路径穿越：用户输入作为文件路径",
	risk: "path-traversal",
}

desc(
	lang: python
	alert_high: 1
	'file://unsafe_path_open.py': <<<UNSAFE
import os
from flask import request

def read_file():
    name = request.args.get("name", "")
    return open(os.path.join("/var/data", name), "r").read()
UNSAFE
	'safefile://safe_path_open.py': <<<SAFE
import pathlib
from flask import abort, request

def read_file():
    name = request.args.get("name", "")
    root = pathlib.Path("/var/data").resolve()
    target = (root / name).resolve()
    if target != root and root not in target.parents:
        abort(404)
    return target.read_text()
SAFE
)
